            "is_markdown": true,
            "count": 3,
            "text": "Thank you, Kevin!\nHow did you stumble on this?\nWas it a helping tool noticing the fact that \"everywhere\" else, `chg = chg || ...` *has* been used ?\n\nAnyway, it's mea culpa when I added much to `smooth()`, in\n svn r11602, 2000-11-30 to the file  `eda/src/smooth.c`\n\nI'll commit the small bug fix , regression test and NEWS RSN.",
            "bug_id": 19280
