            "bug_id": 19280,
            "text": "Thanks Martin! Indeed, it was an AI-assisted audit of the code that noticed this; I took the notes it generated, and validated its assertions myself.\n\nOf course, I cannot call myself an expert here, but the apparent deviation from this common pattern made it stand out.",
